WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
say this is the best, worst logo of all time, the cone?

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:05.560
Yeah, by far, right?

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.160
The logo of VLC is so iconic, right?

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.800
Like, we are a team with a small number of people,

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.280
and the icon is known everywhere.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.960
I go to middle of nowhere in India or in China.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.280
People know the cone, right?

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.440
And 25% of the website traffic that

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:24.280
comes to our main website is cone player, right?

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.040
So many people don't know VLC, right?

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.160
They know the cone player.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.360
There's something that Google Forrest, cone player.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.640
They go on Google, and they put cone player,

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:32.960
and they download VLC, right?

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.240
So that's iconic.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.640
And once we tried to change it as a joke, right?

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:41.560
We said it was going to be a type of caterpillar

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:45.560
construction, and we said that during April 1st.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.040
We had around 10,000 emails saying, no,

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:50.240
don't change the logo and so on.
